","title":"2. How do we ensure pre‑shift inspections are actually completed — not rushed or skipped?"}},{"type":"accordion_item","props":{"content":"Powerfleet verifies operator identity and certification status at the moment of use. Equipment remains locked until the operator meets training and certification requirements. This eliminates uncertified usage, prevents PIN sharing, and centralizes certification management for safer, more consistent operations.
