","title":"7. How do we maintain consistent safety and compliance standards across every shift and facility?"}},{"type":"accordion_item","props":{"content":"Powerfleet is built to enable a coaching‑forward, prevention‑focused culture, not punishment. Data and alerts support constructive conversations, reinforce consistent expectations, and help supervisors guide safer behaviors. This builds adoption and trust across teams.","title":"8. How can we introduce safety technology without creating resistance or a “Big Brother” perception?"}},{"type":"accordion_item","props":{"content":"Yes. Powerfleet is designed to integrate with a wide range of equipment types, ages, and OEM brands, making it ideal for operations with mixed fleets or legacy assets. No major hardware overhaul or equipment replacement is required to get started.
","title":"9. Will Powerfleet work with older or mixed‑brand forklifts and equipment?"}},{"type":"accordion_item","props":{"content":"Organizations commonly achieve measurable operational improvements shortly after deployment — including reduced incidents, lower damage costs, improved utilization, and strengthened compliance.","title":"10. How quickly can we expect ROI from Powerfleet On‑Site?"}}],"name":"Industry Accordion"}]},{"type":"column","props":{"image_position":"center-center","position_sticky_breakpoint":"m","width_medium":"1-6","width_small":"1-1"}}]}],"name":"Accordion FAQ"}],"version":"5.0.54","props":[]}}}

